# Azog, Moria's Ruin: "where X is that creature's power" - the power it last had on the battlefield (CR 608.2h, the ruling), after
# the trigger has gone on the stack. Bot1 targets Bot2's Llanowar Elves; Bot2 answers with Giant Growth on it, making it a 4/4.
# The Elves is destroyed, its controller Bot2 amasses Goblins 4: a 4/4 Goblin Army, not a 1/1. Bot1 did not control the Elves
# and draws nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Azog, Moria's Ruin
Plains x3
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Giant Growth
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Azog, Moria's Ruin.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Giant Growth
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Goblin Army Token
Bot2.Battlefield.Goblin Army Token.Power = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Goblin Army Token.Toughness = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Goblin Army Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 4
